Security Architecture & PermissionsRecorder Role: Only the address assigned the RECORDER_ROLE in the Virtue Audit Registry can submit trade scores.Security Recommendation: The recorder address should be secured behind a Multi-Signature (Multisig) wallet or secure automated oracle operator.OpenZeppelin Security: Standardized AccessControl, ERC20Votes, and TimelockController contracts ensure time-tested safety guarantees.Deployment SequenceDeploy Virtue Audit Registry: Initialize with your admin wallet address.Grant Recorder Role: Assign RECORDER_ROLE to your backend score calculation service/oracle.Deploy MyGovernance: Pass the deployed Virtue Audit Registry address as its reputation reference source.Tech Stack & LicensingLanguage: Solidity 0.8.20Frameworks: OpenZeppelin Governance, Aragon Framework (BTG1/BTG2 base)Licenses:BTG1 & BTG2: AGPL-3.0-or-laterMyGovernance & Virtue Audit Registry: MIT
